    "answer": {
      "short": "$a=4$",
      "worked": "$S_\\infty=6$, $r=\\frac{1}{3}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}S_\\infty&=\\frac{a}{1-r}\\\\6&=\\frac{a}{1-\\frac{1}{3}}\\\\6&=\\frac{a}{\\frac{2}{3}}\\\\6&=\\frac{3a}{2}\\\\a&=4\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
